                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon and light armour. Composite bow +3, javelins +2, shield +2. Rides in a chariot bought at additional cost from this list. Army General. 0-1 General. (Chariot Wars p.14)</characteristic>
