            <profile id="0f0d-c53e-fb25-2d70" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="513c-2d0a-024a-da5a" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">One crewman armed with composite bow, javelins, light armour and shield riding in a two-horse light chariot with a driver. Egyptian charioteers do not suffer -1 to hit for shooting on the move and may shoot as they charge (after enemy charge reactions); counts as short range. Enemy units that take 25% casualties must pass a Panic test or flee. (Chariot Wars p.15)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="e77d-14bb-521e-5149" name="Egyptian Charioteers" hidden="false" targetId="6b39-e5a3-cab0-28f7" type="rule"/>
