              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon, javelins and shield. Light Infantry, Chariot Runners. Up to one unit of Chariot Runners for each unit of Chariots in the army. In an earlier Egyptian army of a period before chariots you may use this troop type to represent Egyptian javelinmen. (Chariot Wars p.15)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
