              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Khepesh (sickle sword), axe, mace or other hand weapon, throwing spear and shield. May have a double-handed weapon such as a mace-axe instead of throwing spear (+1 pt). One unit may have light armour (+2 pts). (Chariot Wars p.16)</characteristic>
