              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">A unit may be entirely armed with bows, entirely armed with javelins and shields or include both in any proportions. Each model in the unit may fight as armed, or you may declare the entire unit to be archers or hand-to-hand fighters depending on the greater proportion represented in the unit. (Chariot Wars p.16)</characteristic>
