              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">One crewman armed with composite bow and javelins, light armour and shield riding in a two-horse light chariot with a driver. May have thrusting spear +3. Egyptian charioteers rule as Chariots. 0-1 unit. (Chariot Wars p.18)</characteristic>
